                                "sense_id": "eea475d6-174c-3afe-aadb-f9a544104660",
                                "text": "1929, Time, 25 March, 1929, \"Apple Salt,\" https://web.archive.org/web/20130721133038/http://www.time.com/time/magazine/article/0,9171,846362,00.html\nLast week. Dr. John Christian Krantz Jr., chemist and pharmacist at Johns Hopkins, announced that that laboratory of many a beneficient drug had created a salt substitute, which has proved palatable during a year's tests."
